    ('mprc_chat_story_director_summary', 'Mprc Chat Story Director Summary', 'multiline', 'Play', 'Cast mode: Focused speaker for single-character Play turns; Joined cast for opening/setup and auto ensemble turns.\nCurrent prompt mode: Joined cast.\nFocused speaker: Mentor.\nNarrator voice/persona: Story Narrator.\nDirector controls: pacing=Slow / Audiobook, dialogue=Balanced narrator + character dialogue, tone=Keep current, agency=Guided, ending=Offer choices.\nStructured JSON: on, scope=every turn.\nInstructor assist: off, AR turns=off.\nSpeaker discipline: narration, character dialogue, choices, and story audio tags are kept in separate blocks for routing.', (), True, False, {}),
